      ro: "Baoding este situat Ã®n inima provinciei Hebei, la aproximativ 140 de kilometri sud-vest de Beijing, servind timp de secole ca un scut strategic pentru capitalÄƒ. OraÈ™ul are o istorie bogatÄƒ care dateazÄƒ din perioada Statelor Combatante È™i a fost mult timp capitala provinciei Zhili Ã®n timpul dinastiei Qing. O bijuterie culturalÄƒ a oraÈ™ului este GrÄƒdina Vechiului Iaz cu Lotus, una dintre cele mai faimoase grÄƒdini clasice din nordul Chinei, amenajatÄƒ Ã®ncÄƒ din timpul dinastiei Yuan. Baoding este, de asemenea, cunoscut pentru specialitatea sa culinarÄƒ, burgerul cu carne de mÄƒgar, care este apreciat Ã®n Ã®ntreaga È›arÄƒ. ÃŽn era modernÄƒ, oraÈ™ul a devenit un pionier Ã®n industria energiei solare È™i eoliene, gÄƒzduind companii importante Ã®n domeniul energiilor regenerabile. De asemenea, este sediul mai multor universitÄƒÈ›i È™i institute de cercetare importante, ceea ce Ã®l face un centru educaÈ›ional al regiunii. PoziÈ›ia geograficÄƒ Ã®ntre Beijing, Tianjin È™i Shijiazhuang face din Baoding o componentÄƒ centralÄƒ a integrÄƒrii economice a nordului. ÃŽn ciuda modernizÄƒrii, oraÈ™ul Ã®È™i pÄƒstreazÄƒ monumentele istorice, precum clÄƒdirea arhivei imperiale din perioada Ming, care vorbesc despre importanÈ›a sa administrativÄƒ din trecut.",
      en: "Baoding is situated in the heart of Hebei Province, approximately 140 kilometers southwest of Beijing, and served for centuries as a strategic shield for the capital. The city has a rich history dating back to the Warring States period and was for a long time the capital of Zhili Province during the Qing Dynasty. A cultural jewel of the city is the Ancient Lotus Flower Pond, one of northern China's most famous classical gardens, established as early as the Yuan Dynasty. Baoding is also renowned for its culinary specialty, the donkey meat burger, which is cherished across the country. In the modern era, the city has emerged as a pioneer in the solar and wind energy industries, hosting major companies in the renewable energy sector. Additionally, it is the seat of several important universities and research institutes, making it an educational hub of the region. Its geographical location between Beijing, Tianjin, and Shijiazhuang makes Baoding a central component of the economic integration of the North. Despite modernization, the city preserves its historical monuments, such as the Ming-era imperial archive building, which speak of its past administrative significance.",
      es: "Baoding es una ciudad histÃ³rica de la provincia de Hebei y en otro tiempo fue la capital provincial. Situada cerca de PekÃ­n, alberga la Oficina del Gobernador de Zhili, una de las sedes gubernamentales mejor conservadas de la dinastÃ­a Qing. La ciudad tambiÃ©n es conocida por su medicina tradicional china y las bolas de Baoding.",
